@Cyclo_Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5118


### Get Activity
GET {{Cyclo_Api_HostAddress}}/activities/87a273fa-c74b-4300-483a-08df3ab801c5
Accept: application/json


### Get Activity with wrong guid
GET {{Cyclo_Api_HostAddress}}/activities/87a273fa-c74b-4300-483a-08df3ab801c9
Accept: application/json


### Get Activity with id wich is not guid
GET {{Cyclo_Api_HostAddress}}/activities/12345
Accept: application/json


### Upload GPX file
POST {{Cyclo_Api_HostAddress}}/activities
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=Boundary

--Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="ride.gpx"
Content-Type: application/gpx+xml

< ../../tests/Cyclo.Core.Tests/TestData/Private/activity_23911368613.gpx
--Boundary--


### Same File
POST {{Cyclo_Api_HostAddress}}/activities
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=Boundary

--Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="ride.gpx"
Content-Type: application/gpx+xml

< ../../tests/Cyclo.Core.Tests/TestData/Private/activity_23911368613.gpx
--Boundary--


### Not .gpx fileName (.txt)
POST {{Cyclo_Api_HostAddress}}/activities
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=Boundary

--Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="ride.txt"
Content-Type: application/gpx+xml

< ../../tests/Cyclo.Core.Tests/TestData/Private/activity_23911368613.gpx
--Boundary--